    "body": "Hi @lorthirk, I think the virtualenv is coming from something other than starship. You can test this by running starship explain which will display a break down of what starship displays. At a guess it might be added by `eval \"$(pyenv virtualenv-init -)\"` which I think you can disable by setting the env var `PYENV_VIRTUALENV_DISABLE_PROMPT` to 1. ",
